{
  "info": {
    "name": "Opero · ERP Simulator (E4)",
    "description": "Endpoints do ERP simulado: contexto do cliente (catálogo/preço/estoque), criação de pedido com idempotência e consulta do pedido. Todos exigem o header X-API-Key. POST /orders exige também Idempotency-Key.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/erp" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "dev-erp-api-key" },
    { "key": "customer_id", "value": "8", "description": "Troque pelo id retornado em GET /api/erp/context/{id} ou consultado via manage.py shell" },
    { "key": "idempotency_key", "value": "demo-key-1", "description": "Troque para gerar um pedido novo; repita para testar idempotência" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "GET Context (cliente + catálogo + preço + estoque)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{api_key}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/context/{{customer_id}}/",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["context", "{{customer_id}}", ""]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST Order (criar pedido — idempotente)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Salva o id retornado para usar na request GET Order",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    const body = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', body.id);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Status é 200 (repetido) ou 201 (novo)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idempotency_key}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customer\": {{customer_id}},\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"sku\": \"CERV-PILSEN-350\", \"quantity\": 10, \"unit_price\": 54.0, \"subtotal\": 540.0 }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 540.0\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", ""]
        },
        "description": "Envie 2x seguidas sem mudar o Idempotency-Key: a 1ª volta 201, a 2ª volta 200 com o mesmo id/external_order_number (nenhum pedido duplicado). Troque idempotency_key para criar um pedido novo."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GET Order (recibo do pedido)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{api_key}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", "{{order_id}}", ""]
        },
        "description": "order_id é preenchido automaticamente pelo test script da request POST Order."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GET Context sem API key (esperado 403)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/context/{{customer_id}}/",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["context", "{{customer_id}}", ""]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST Order sem Idempotency-Key (esperado 400)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{api_key}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customer\": {{customer_id}},\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"sku\": \"CERV-PILSEN-350\", \"quantity\": 10, \"unit_price\": 54.0 }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 540.0\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["orders", ""]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
